OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe odd light shower is
OL,6,Fpossible at first, mainly near to
OL,7,FIrish Sea coasts, but most areas look
OL,8,Fset to have a dry day with sunny
OL,9,Fspells. A brisk northwesterly wind
OL,10,Fwill ease, and feeling pleasant enough
OL,11,Fin the sunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA ridge of high pressure will
OL,14,Ftopple across bringing a mostly dry
OL,15,Fnight with clear spells. Turning
OL,16,Fchilly in rural areas. However, some
OL,17,Fcloud arriving from the west later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
