OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FEarly bright spells will
OL,6,Fgive way to increasing cloud from the
OL,7,Fwest on Thursday morning, and this
OL,8,Fwill lead into a wet and quite
OL,9,Fblustery afternoon. Some heavy rain
OL,10,Fdeveloping.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBrighter
OL,13,Fweather returns on Friday, with
OL,14,Fsunshine and occasional light showers.
OL,15,FA spell of wind and rain is likely on
OL,16,FSaturday, ahead of another bright day
OL,17,Fwith showers on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
